// The sprites of BLACK ICE. # is ink, . is paper (inside a sprite), and _ is
// transparent. Programs and malware are 24 by 24, in tiles of 28; what a card
// does is 9 by 9; a spark and a chip of the core are 10 by 10; the icon of the
// game in the gallery is 32 by 32.

